From 37eca19f1813b5158229142aa1b4bd85122b0610 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DQQ123164 <195072927+DQQ123164@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 14:53:30 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Adapt ysyxSoC for ysyx_26010028

Adapt the SoC integration, update SDRAM DPI support, and restore the standard AXI slave interface.
